      "duration_seconds": 31.54,
      "text": "actually, it's been about a week now. And I've been feeling very unwell as well. I've also had severe tummy pain out of proportion to the examination, since yesterday. About severe tummy pain out of proportion to the examination, pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I did have bloody diarrhoea at one point, but that's gone now"
