      "start_seconds": 319.46,
      "end_seconds": 350.14,
      "duration_seconds": 30.68,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I'd lean towards possible bowel ischaemia. Another possibility is pancreatitis. I think an urgent CT angiogram makes sense here, for possible bowel ischaemia. I'm sending you for urgent blood tests cos of severe abdominal pain. This is an emergency, you are gonna hospital now. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
